   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why: LFA Lab teaches the standard, not\nour guess. Example D18 (RFC 9855): the\nclean-up also drops AdjSID(S→N) (§5.1).",
